; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on BTCUSD - best trailing of M15: Bollinger trailing (TrailMode 10), setup 2 of 5: sell, session 1200-2000 server time, trend filter M30 EMA 50, target 2R. DO NOT LOAD ON GOLD.
; Trailing: stop beyond the Bollinger band SMA(20) -/+ 1 sd of M15, once the profit reaches 1R. Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 10, TrailParam 0).
; Picked on Jan 2025 - May 15 2026 only, by the one-minute backtest at the study's costs (10 USD spread; score 1.47): 84 trades, PF 1.71. Replay of the same months: 84 trades, PF 1.66.
; REPLAY ON BINANCE BTCUSDT ONE-SECOND PRICES (four price points per second; the EA's rules; 10 USD spread, no commission). May 16 - Nov 13 2026 (the trailing was chosen on these months): this setup 35 trades, PF 1.62, net +10.5R (stressed PF 1.53); the 5 setups of M15 + Bollinger together 169 trades, PF 0.96, net -2.4R (stressed 0.91).
; Bollinger was chosen as the best of the EA's trailing systems on M15 (highest PF of those with 100+ trades in those months), so the 2026 figure is the score it was chosen by, not a test. Even so the set lost money in those months (PF 0.96): it is here only because the zip has the best system of every timeframe.
; EARLIER DATA, not used for any choice (same replay and costs): this setup: 2024, 69 trades, PF 1.06; 2023 (from Jan 15), 71 trades, PF 0.92. The 5 setups together: 2024, 360 trades, PF 1.06; 2023 (from Jan 15), 359 trades, PF 0.84. They did not hold (under 1.3): UNPROVEN, Strategy Tester and demo only.
; Data: Binance BTCUSDT, broker server time. Points are 0.01 USD: 2000 points = 20 USD.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer).
; UseNewsFilter is on: on demo or live the EA skips entries within 30 minutes of high-impact USD news, which the replay did not do (no effect in the Strategy Tester). Set it to false to trade exactly what was replayed.
